Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.14,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}ヴァージンロード ご入場
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.27,0:22:51.10,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}わたしもパパと できるかな？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.52,0:22:53.73,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}受け取れなかった ブーケトス
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:55.65,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}いいもん　花嫁よりダンゴだもん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:59.74,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}今度はギュッと つかむよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.74,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}ケーキカットの そのあとは
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:08.20,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}ファーストバイト おいしそう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:12.46,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}きっと　いつかはあの人と
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:14.59,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}はにかみながら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:16.71,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}目と目をあわせ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:21.22,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,84)}いただきまーす！と 口あけて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:25.47,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}honey honey honeyなdish!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:27.60,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}sugar sugar sugarなkiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.85,0:23:31.39,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}めくるめくの 愛の味
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.73,0:23:33.94,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,84)}comin' comin' comin'なwish!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:36.11,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,126)}sugar sugar sugarなkiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.78,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}甘い未来 食べさせて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:41.28,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}あーんme!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:45.14,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}今天第一次參加婚禮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.14,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}歡迎來到virgin road
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.27,0:22:51.10,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}我也能和爸爸一起走嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.52,0:22:53.73,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}沒接到花束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:55.65,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}哼 比起當新娘我還是喜歡團子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:59.74,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}下次一定要好好接住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.74,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}蛋糕切好以後
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:08.20,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}張嘴吃下第一口 看起來好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:12.46,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}有朝一日 我跟他也一定會
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:14.59,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}靦靦腆腆地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:16.71,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}四目相對
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:21.22,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,84)}「我不客氣啦」 然後張開嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:25.47,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}甘美的菜餚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:27.60,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}甜蜜的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.85,0:23:31.39,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}飄飄欲仙的愛的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.73,0:23:33.94,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,84)}未來的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:36.11,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,126)}甜蜜的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.78,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}甜美的未來 就讓我餵你吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:41.28,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}啊——啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓果然不同凡響啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮  羨慕死了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說要當結婚雜誌的模特兒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還以為我也能穿輕飄飄的可愛衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  對方要求有一個男性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們的事務所又沒人選
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  我要鬧彆扭了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這很適合真君呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.87,0:00:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且這條領帶的品味也讓人佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:48.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.63,0:02:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒想到第一次穿婚紗是工作需要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前覺得自己在此之前就已經結婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚慾望很強呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但總覺得像這樣努力著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天能遇到我的白馬王子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  製作人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這件禮服馬上就要換掉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  午休後就要換別的衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我幫忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是發給朋友而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(60,20)\fs18}「我要奔向幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(135,40)\fs18}真抱歉  其實我下個月28號就要結婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(83,60)\fs18}雖然說好不會偷跑的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(50,80)\fs18}真的很抱歉」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣…發送
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,友美一定會嚇一跳的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  友美
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用這麼驚訝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算結婚又有什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:35.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙你的騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實只是結婚雜誌的模特兒而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次見面再好好聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該馬上就能請到假了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦…我什麼時候走到這裡來的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  您掉東西…了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:11.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  找到新娘了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻就過去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  回婚禮現場了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…還有攝影…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.58,0:04:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓小姐到哪裡去打電話了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便當都已經來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個是梓小姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓…梓小姐被拐走了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我親眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:49.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的確是梓的手機
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人  現在立刻就去救人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希  我們會盡快回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幫我們拖延下時間吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希我會試試的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們明白您不願意和從未相識的人結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我們的主人是很了不起的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您也一定會滿意的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之立刻回到婚禮現場
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…請問是不是認錯人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是三浦梓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要穿那麼容易混淆的衣服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且…這個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了  是結婚戒指
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得還給那位新娘才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  工作室那邊也要回去一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:06:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來  我到底是從哪裡過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:06.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不幹  這種父母間決定的婚事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打死都不幹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣說  我們主人也是打心底想要娶您
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都把先祖代代相傳的傳家寶戒送您了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這正是其證明
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種戒指還你就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.57,0:06:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉哪兒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來…剛才那人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會錯的  是傳家寶戒指
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快回去找
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手機也掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼去工作室…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  坐計程車就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:02.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  我想問一下路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我離開村莊來這裡見兒子但卻迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去那個叫Land  Land  Tower的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那地方好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該就在那
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真對不起  我也在趕路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你幫忙了  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是先帶您去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人  再快點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別強人所難了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那輛車…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人  就是那輛車拐走梓小姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,計程車
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請跟著前面那輛車
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.89,0:08:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是警察什麼的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是藝人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住  把梓小姐帶哪兒去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓？是剛才那人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些人也在找戒指嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.41,0:08:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在車站目擊到穿著婚紗的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全員立即前往
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解  趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別讓戒指被搶了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住  誘拐犯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真  很危險的  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請給我發票
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目標從車站前往中華街
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全員立即前往
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:49.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  我也一起找
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我帶路
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別廢話  帶我去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉  我忘記自己也是路盲了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你  我一個人肯定也會迷路的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  俊嗣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  沒迷路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說在那個Land  Land  Tower碰面的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是約好在這個Marine  Port  Tower等嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不是您帶母親過來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道該怎麼辦了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡哪裡  只是路盲碰巧走對路而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給你添麻煩了  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老婆婆也保重
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我也要快點找輛計程車
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:09:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這兩個孩子的母親在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解  發現後立即確保
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有消息說在肉包子店目擊到那女的了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是剛才那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不會把梓小姐交給你們的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很燙要當心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好  我也想讓她吹吹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也去買肉包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs22}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:54.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我肉包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開  讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…那個…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓小姐～
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像聽到了真的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來這是幸運肉包呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金錢運一般般
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛運馬馬虎虎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要找的人在前方3米？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:30.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  我也該回去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是呢  三浦小姐和菊地君都不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只剩你了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正待會兒也要拍她的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在三浦回來之前先拍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:57.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也只有這樣了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:11:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快點準備一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用著急
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在梓她們回來之前  要給美希
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  那個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了  梓
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什  你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,認  認錯人了  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓  你在哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  不過剛才那人挺帥的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥都畫不出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.55,0:12:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有什麼能激發靈感呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靈感來啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:54.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真頭疼啊  哪都找不到計程車站  咦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子疼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  能拜託你看下店嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.27,0:14:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得趕快點回去工作才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很擔心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  能幫我占卜一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  好  那個  不過可能不準
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好精彩的電影啊  正好到高潮了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個演員  好帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實啊  我被跟我有婚約的女士甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是今天就要離開日本了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以最後想在日本找一個能留下美好回憶的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該去哪比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了  我試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這個  要怎麼用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是塔羅牌還能懂一些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之  萬事試為先
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是港口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  我就去看一看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人只有一個哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,費用放在裡面了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是幫大忙了  必須要好好答謝你才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來  能告訴我計程車站在哪裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  就這事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個的話  看  在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  不錯哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美希個人覺得婚紗再加點躍動感會比較好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯啊  很新穎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  攝影師  美希突然想在海邊拍攝了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個  就這麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人  真的往這裡來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  有目擊情報說走過這個天橋了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這前面有什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩天輪和港口
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真是個難得的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真頭疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然和計程車的隊伍搞錯  排到摩天輪的隊伍去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  風景真是不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  戒指在我這裡哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能聽到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  請快點讓我下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  是最高級的金華火腿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.05,0:17:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  快停下來啊  店都亂套了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣根本做不了生意了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,商品的損失  你要賠償
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  就算你這麼對我說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  不好了  目標往港口去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  沒工夫在這瞎耗了  快追快追
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  那邊好像發生什麼事了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在啊  去那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請等一下  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  哎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓  我馬上就來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把戒指奪回來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快賠錢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你對我這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:19:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種金額的支票  我受不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請一定接受肉包子的謝禮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畫  請收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  戒指  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.47,0:19:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  這附近和想像的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  那麼開始佈置吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  梓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那  那是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  戒指  戒指…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  梓  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戒指在我這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丟失的戒指
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:20:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  吶  攝影師
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  絕對要拍下來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:03.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…來送戒指的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒了它  你一定很為難吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物歸原主了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  你們的主人在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種戒指  給我都不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真是  太遺憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  那時候的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石油王大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:49.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  居然是這種超級帥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面  我是石油王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能和我結婚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的求婚  我接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來  你的占卜很準啊  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.21,0:21:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要幸福哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真  這演的是哪齣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…我也一頭霧水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:30.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  真  製作人  來接我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  梓  平安就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們久等了  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來的拍攝  還趕得上嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然可以了  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好的照片  已經拍下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:49.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  登載了登載了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.67,0:21:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個雜誌  因為這張照片而大受好評哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不斷地增印
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:22:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梓和龍宮小町的知名度也是一下子提高了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也登載了很多美希和真的照片哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  看啊  這個真非常帥哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中華街的修理費  都是石油王出的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  因為一半是他們的原因啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,友美發來的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(70,20)\fs18}「告訴你一個好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(40,40)\fs18}那個啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,60)\fs18}聽說沒有婚約卻穿了婚紗的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(63,80)\fs18}婚期會延遲哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說沒有婚約卻穿了婚紗的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.42,0:22:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婚期會延遲哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:35.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真遺憾啊  梓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下週的偶像大師
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.84,0:24:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是水瀨伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:03.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家全都是幸運兒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.51,0:24:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為每週都能看到伊織的漂亮臉蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.35,0:24:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以下週也
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好期待吧
